# Thread watching rides out GitHub being unreachable: CST starts with no network,
# says it will keep retrying, picks up once GitHub answers, says so, and reports
# the next outage afresh. Each poll is a minute apart, so this takes about four.

size 110x30
# The thread watcher only runs with the multiplexer.
arg --mux
fake_gh
session app Waiting on a reply
watch_thread https://github.com/o/r/discussions/7
timeout 150000

# As after a night asleep: CST comes up before the network does.
github down
wait_for Thread watching will keep retrying
expect error connecting to api.github.com
dump 01-down-at-startup

github up
wait_for Thread watching reached GitHub again
dump 02-reached-again

# The same words as the first outage, and still reported.
github down
wait_for Thread watching will keep retrying
dump 03-down-again
